armland and other low-lying areas along NC 200.  Floodwaters may also approach NC 200 and backwater effects will likely cause significant flooding of Parks Lafferty Rd.  Floodwaters may also approach a driveway to a care facility at the 5300 block of NC 200 and access may be restricted."}, {"stage": 22, "statement": "Minor Flooding continues.  Cox Mill Road, N.C. Route 200, and Mount Pleasant Road may flood."}, {"stage": 19, "statement": "Minor Flooding continues.  Mount Pleasant Road, N.C. Route 200, and Bonaza Drive may flood."}, {"stage": 18.5, "statement": "Minor Flooding continues. Flooding of Dutch Buffalo Creek, a tributary to the Rocky River, may cause flooding of Bowman Barrier Road between Long Run Farm Road and the Mount Pleasant City Limits."}, {"stage": 18, "statement": "Minor Flood Stage.  Flooding of Muddy Creek, a tributary to the Rocky River, may cause flooding of Hopewell Church Road."}, {"stage": 17, "statement": "Minor Flooding continues.  Stallings Road and Poplar Tent Road may be flooded."}, {"stage": 16.5, "statement": "Legacy Minor Flood Stage. Pharr Mill Road between Rocky River Road and Sequoia Hill Road may be submerged by up to 1 foot of water.  Floodwaters may approach Stallings Road and Mount Pleasant Road."}, {"stage": 14, "statement": "Action Stage.  Flooding along Back Creek south of Harrisburg may occur near the intersection of Robinson Church Road and Stallings Road which is near Middleton and Rocky Meadows subdivisions."}, {"stage": 12, "statement": "Legacy Action or Bankfull Stage.  Flooding from Back Creek may approach but not reach Pharr Mill Road due to backwater effects from Rocky River."}, {"stage": 7, "statement": "At this level, some low lying areas downstream around Midland, along Muddy Creek, may start to flood due to backwater effects of the Rocky River."}]}, "images": {"probability": {"weekint": {"stage": "", "flow": "", "volume": ""}, "entperiod": {"stage": "", "flow": "", "volume": ""}, "shortrange": ""}, "hydrograph